            "review_title": "Review at Soy Pepe",
            "review_text": "Franck G\nCat Ba, Vietnam17 contributions\n0\nTofuliscious\nApr 2023 • Friends\nThis Asian restaurant truly impressed me with their tofu-focused menu. The platter I ordered was an assortment of tofu dishes, each with unique flavors and textures. From crispy bites to silky soups, every bite was a delicious surprise.\n\nThe attention to detail in preparation was remarkable, with perfectly balanced flavors and just-right portion sizes. The staff was friendly. The cozy ambiance and attentive service added to the experience.\n\nIf you love tofu or want to try something new, this place is a must-visit. Highly recommended !\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten May 17, 2023\nSoy Pepe\nThanks ! See you again !\nWritten May 20, 2023\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
